# Converted from tests/test_dfc_ev1_conformance.c test /create-file-beyond-capacity (now removed): the literal
# APDUs and statuses the unit test asserted are replayed here byte for byte,
# and the engine's answers are the ones the test required. On the default 2 KiB card free memory starts at 0x000800; a 0x000801 byte file is out of EEPROM, a 0x000800 byte file fits and leaves no free memory, after which even a record file is out of EEPROM. The GetVersion storage code check is ev1_get-version-frames.vec.

